  "scope": [
    "A portable backup with a published 40-event attachment lists its whole-archive dependency.",
    "Restores with both cohorts omitted or a same-owner substitute refuse before creating the destination. The serving predecessor retains its epoch.",
    "Owner-authenticated publication-source export refuses a digest outside the native catalog. The exported original is byte-identical and the real handover restores it from that export.",
    "The new Reader verifies both authors and the exact attachment after replay, authenticated handover and restart. Source and independently installed runs also exercise the earlier alternate-only workflow with no published attachment.",
    "The native source-selection test covers both selected and alternate cohorts, an unrelated replacement, and a journal from a different family."
  ]
